WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:03.425
限定本轮消息路径 / Scope this run’s message paths

2
00:00:03.425 --> 00:00:06.510
开启 Recording / Start Recording

3
00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.708
发送六条公开消息 / Send six public messages

4
00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:12.999
选择本轮连接 / Select this run’s connection

5
00:00:12.999 --> 00:00:16.154
打开消息页 / Open the messages tab

6
00:00:16.154 --> 00:00:19.329
选择 Sent 消息 / Select sent messages

7
00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:22.700
展开 guide-short / Expand guide-short

8
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.786
选择 Raw 查看原文 / Select Raw to inspect the text

9
00:00:25.786 --> 00:00:28.824
复制当前短消息正文 / Copy the current short message body

10
00:00:28.824 --> 00:00:31.824
收起短消息 / Collapse the short message

11
00:00:31.824 --> 00:00:35.030
展开 guide-long / Expand guide-long

12
00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.319
拖动正文右下角缩小高度 / Drag the body corner to reduce its height

13
00:00:38.319 --> 00:00:41.375
在长消息中滚动 / Scroll inside the long message

14
00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:44.360
用键盘到达消息末尾 / Reach the message end with the keyboard

15
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:47.377
到底后继续滚动消息列表 / Continue scrolling the list at the body boundary

16
00:00:47.377 --> 00:00:50.389
复制完整长消息正文 / Copy the complete long message body

17
00:00:50.389 --> 00:00:53.428
复制 binary 消息的原始 Hex / Copy the binary message as original Hex

18
00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:56.627
全屏查看这条消息 / View this message fullscreen

19
00:00:56.627 --> 00:00:59.711
Escape 返回同一消息 / Return to the same message with Escape

20
00:00:59.711 --> 00:01:02.916
在新连接发送205条消息 / Send 205 messages on a new connection

21
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:05.929
选择新的 pages 连接 / Select the new pages connection

22
00:01:05.929 --> 00:01:08.917
打开新连接的消息 / Open messages for the new connection

23
00:01:08.917 --> 00:01:12.380
滚动加载后续消息页 / Scroll to load subsequent message pages

24
00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:15.492
展开第205条消息 / Expand message 205

25
00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:18.420
复制最后一条并核对 index 204 / Copy the last message and verify index 204
